  "prompt": "One contact can come back as several leads with the same email. Counting each contact once, under the source of their earliest lead (the one with the earliest created_at), how many contacts did each source bring in? created_at is Brussels local time. When two leads of an email tie on created_at, the lower lead_id is kept. Return two columns, in this order: source and contacts. Return one row for each source of some earliest lead. Any row order is fine.",
